Important: This application will not work while connected to the school Wi‑Fi network.
The school network blocks external OAuth login requests, which prevents Google Sign‑In from completing.
To use the app, please connect to your home Wi‑Fi or mobile hotspot before logging in.
Run app.py or go on the site https://middle-room-education-system.onrender.com/
Then for Superadmin Access Sign into the website with Email: superadmin@superadmin.com Password: superadmin
Then for Admin Access Sign into the website with Email: admin@admin.com Password: Admin
And as a user sign in as yourself